        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"Chromium_Man\"]\n3) &nbsp;Against Omnitron in Wagner Mars Base. &nbsp;Self-Destruct Sequence and one other card were in play when Omnitron played Terraforming. &nbsp;When the AI gave me a choice for order of destruction for the Environment cards it was showing three cards.&nbsp; ...&nbsp; I guess if I was feeling up for a challenge I could&#39;ve destroyed the card under SDS first and then SDS and the other card so Omnitron would play three cards. &nbsp;I definitely wouldn&#39;t have thought that the card under SDS counted. \n[/quote]\n\nDestroying *some* cards under SDS would lead to a greater challenge.&nbsp; Destroying *all* of them leads to an instant game over, as it triggers the SDS!\n",
        "actions_summary": [
