        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/858c86/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-11-19T22:12:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I had an interesting one yesterday that I never would've thought of:</p><p>Atlantean Font of Power played the top card of Visionary's deck and it was Wrest the Mind with no viable targets in play, so it was discarded and played another card from the top. &nbsp;I know Atlantean Font says to repeat the process if the revealed card is a limited card that is already in play, but in this case that wasn't the issue.</p>",
